WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.860 --> 01:31.100
[My Journey to You]

01:31.120 --> 01:33.910
[Episode 4]

01:36.660 --> 01:38.259
My father was a businessman.

01:39.160 --> 01:40.620
He often sailed out to sea.

01:42.110 --> 01:42.930
Once,

01:44.479 --> 01:46.009
he encountered a shipwreck

01:47.820 --> 01:49.210
and never came back.

01:53.180 --> 01:55.780
Today is the anniversary of my father's death.

01:59.979 --> 02:01.840
There is a saying in our hometown.

02:04.790 --> 02:06.140
If people who died at sea

02:07.060 --> 02:08.780
saw a boat,

02:10.110 --> 02:11.490
they would try to fly onto the boat

02:11.490 --> 02:12.060
and see

02:12.670 --> 02:13.820
if it's their family

02:14.330 --> 02:15.590
coming to pick them up.

02:21.300 --> 02:23.300
Your father won't be disappointed.

02:25.100 --> 02:26.010
In this world,

02:27.440 --> 02:28.570
what father

02:29.140 --> 02:31.340
would be disappointed in his daughter?

02:42.079 --> 02:43.680
Wipe the tears off your face.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.400
I'm sorry.

02:45.650 --> 02:46.800
I hurt you today.

02:54.660 --> 02:55.210
I'm fine.

02:56.240 --> 02:56.930
It's okay.

02:58.190 --> 02:59.260
How can you be fine?

02:59.829 --> 03:01.070
It's indeed my fault.

03:04.340 --> 03:05.460
I'm very powerful.

03:05.820 --> 03:06.750
Don't act tough.

03:08.610 --> 03:09.810
I'll inform the clinic

03:09.810 --> 03:11.780
to perform chiropractic treatment on you.

03:11.780 --> 03:14.180
Then take some medicine to soothe your body

03:14.380 --> 03:16.240
and your shoulder should be fine.

03:18.140 --> 03:19.940
Thank you, Young Master Ziyu...

03:21.250 --> 03:22.710
Thank you, Sword Wielder.

03:24.510 --> 03:26.770
It's better to call me Young Master Ziyu.

03:27.260 --> 03:28.480
I'm not used to

03:29.190 --> 03:30.720
the title of Sword Wielder.

03:32.790 --> 03:33.790
You don't like it?

03:35.829 --> 03:37.579
I said I'm not used to it.

03:40.900 --> 03:41.610
But

03:42.829 --> 03:44.090
I don't like it either.

03:59.480 --> 04:00.120
Miss Yun,

04:00.540 --> 04:01.630
it's getting late.

04:01.980 --> 04:03.240
I have to take you back.

04:05.980 --> 04:06.580
Sorry.

04:07.550 --> 04:09.000
I must send you back.

04:13.770 --> 04:14.400
But

04:15.510 --> 04:17.170
you're the Sword Wielder now.

04:17.839 --> 04:19.649
If you appear with me alone,

04:20.990 --> 04:23.250
I'm afraid it will cause trouble for you.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.110
Do you really not want

04:27.530 --> 04:28.810
to be seen with me?

04:35.740 --> 04:36.620
Don't worry.

04:37.040 --> 04:38.500
I'm not afraid of trouble.

04:39.210 --> 04:41.540
Besides, I'm going to the side residence.

04:42.880 --> 04:44.500
Why are you going there?

04:52.150 --> 04:54.080
Why are you looking at me like that?

04:54.920 --> 04:56.600
Did I say something wrong?

04:58.200 --> 04:59.930
You didn't say anything wrong.

05:00.170 --> 05:01.750
But Miss Yun, your face...

05:02.900 --> 05:04.650
What's wrong with my face?

05:05.800 --> 05:07.460
I heard you were poisoned last night too

05:07.460 --> 05:09.120
and had rashes all over your face.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.320
But seeing you today,

05:10.840 --> 05:12.770
your features look just as before.

05:13.030 --> 05:14.560
You've already recovered?

05:15.460 --> 05:16.110
Poisoned?

05:16.980 --> 05:17.710
How?

05:19.850 --> 05:21.250
You didn't get poisoned?

05:23.340 --> 05:25.950
I just had rashes all over my face last night.

05:26.370 --> 05:29.220
I heard that Miss Shangguan comes from a family of physicians,

05:29.220 --> 05:32.100
so I asked her for some ointment to relieve the poison.

05:32.100 --> 05:35.480
It's indeed effective after dissolving and drinking it with water.

05:35.480 --> 05:37.230
It went away in one night.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.890
What did you eat

05:42.460 --> 05:43.920
before you got the rashes?

05:45.820 --> 05:46.970
Nothing.

05:49.220 --> 05:51.550
I just visited Miss Shangguan for a while.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.570
We had tea together.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.990
Miss Jiang also fell ill

06:02.140 --> 06:03.340
after drinking the tea

06:03.340 --> 06:04.600
and went to the clinic.

06:05.370 --> 06:07.770
The doctor verified that she was poisoned.

06:13.990 --> 06:16.020
Did the tea belong to Miss Jiang?

06:21.910 --> 06:22.510
Miss Yun,

06:24.890 --> 06:25.730
did the tea

06:26.910 --> 06:28.110
belong to Miss Jiang?

06:29.740 --> 06:32.200
The tea was from Miss Shangguan’s hometown.

06:32.540 --> 06:33.920
Miss Jiang and I

06:34.130 --> 06:36.900
were worried we wouldn't be able to sleep after drinking tea,

06:36.900 --> 06:37.700
but Miss Shangguan

06:37.700 --> 06:39.420
insisted on making it for us.

06:46.170 --> 06:47.100
Take out the tea.

06:47.200 --> 06:48.200
I think...

06:48.600 --> 06:49.110
Yes.

06:51.230 --> 06:52.230
Is everyone here?

06:52.550 --> 06:55.030
Other than Yun Weishan and Shangguan Qian,

06:55.030 --> 06:56.460
all the other girls are here.

06:56.460 --> 06:57.260
What's wrong?

07:00.030 --> 07:01.400
Seal the entire side residence.

07:01.400 --> 07:02.700
Before the Sword Wielder arrives,

07:02.700 --> 07:04.070
no one is allowed to enter or exit.

07:04.070 --> 07:04.780
Yes.

07:05.220 --> 07:06.210
The Sword Wielder is coming?

07:06.210 --> 07:06.610
Yes.

07:06.860 --> 07:08.990
Is it appropriate for him to come here?

07:09.110 --> 07:11.240
The Sword Wielder's words are the law.

07:11.310 --> 07:12.090
But this is too...

07:12.090 --> 07:12.630
Madam Fu,

07:14.710 --> 07:16.640
do you have a problem with my order?

07:17.090 --> 07:17.860
No.

07:19.670 --> 07:21.460
But Young Master, this is too...

07:21.460 --> 07:22.050
Yun...

07:22.590 --> 07:23.700
Miss Yun Weishan,

07:24.630 --> 07:25.550
why are you with

07:26.060 --> 07:27.590
the Sword Wielder?

07:34.350 --> 07:35.610
I have a secret mission

07:35.950 --> 07:38.409
that Miss Yun Weishan must help me complete.

07:43.870 --> 07:44.470
Follow me.

07:44.770 --> 07:46.690
Search the courtyard and every room.

07:46.690 --> 07:47.060
Yes.

08:03.780 --> 08:05.440
The river lanterns are ready.

08:06.470 --> 08:07.930
The show is about to start.

08:11.930 --> 08:12.790
Sword Wielder,

08:13.150 --> 08:14.080
these tea leaves

08:14.180 --> 08:16.510
were found in Miss Shangguan Qian's room.

08:17.100 --> 08:17.880
This powder

08:18.050 --> 08:19.710
was found in Miss Song's room.

08:19.960 --> 08:21.760
It was contained in this bottle.

08:23.130 --> 08:23.840
This is...

08:25.340 --> 08:25.970
This is...

08:37.409 --> 08:38.299
If I were you,

08:39.260 --> 08:41.620
I would wash my nails right now.

08:45.500 --> 08:46.090
Halt!

08:48.740 --> 08:49.980
Scrape off the rest

08:50.690 --> 08:52.150
before you wash yourself.

09:12.050 --> 09:14.110
Do you want to leave evidence behind?

09:14.410 --> 09:15.980
If the Gong family can't find any evidence,

09:15.980 --> 09:17.870
they will keep investigating.

09:17.980 --> 09:19.310
It'll be never-ending.

09:19.950 --> 09:20.830
It's time

09:20.980 --> 09:22.520
to put an end to this.

09:22.940 --> 09:23.860
How?

09:25.710 --> 09:27.040
Find a reasonable owner

09:27.160 --> 09:28.350
for this thing.

09:34.950 --> 09:35.680
Give it to me.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.440
I know whose room to put it in.

09:40.220 --> 09:40.790
Whose?

09:45.120 --> 09:46.130
Miss Song.

09:47.360 --> 09:47.990
Miss.

09:49.150 --> 09:51.480
You are suffering from asthma.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.360
If you have asthma,

09:53.810 --> 09:55.470
it's definitely not suitable

09:55.510 --> 09:57.310
to stay in the valley long-term.

09:57.680 --> 09:59.280
Your condition will worsen.

10:00.660 --> 10:01.480
No.

10:01.860 --> 10:03.520
I just caught a cold last night

10:04.090 --> 10:05.140
and have a cough.

10:06.630 --> 10:08.030
I'll write it down first.

10:08.710 --> 10:09.590
Later,

10:09.950 --> 10:12.150
I will give you a private consultation.

10:15.010 --> 10:16.410
The powder is poisonous.

10:18.060 --> 10:18.920
How could it be?

10:19.310 --> 10:20.300
This is the asthma medicine

10:20.300 --> 10:21.600
I brought from home.

10:22.530 --> 10:23.460
It's not poison.

10:47.630 --> 10:49.100
Those who enter the Gong residence

10:49.100 --> 10:50.680
are thoroughly searched.

10:51.180 --> 10:53.510
No medication is allowed to be brought in.

10:55.430 --> 10:56.470
Where did you hide

10:56.470 --> 10:57.600
this little bottle?

10:59.630 --> 11:00.610
I put it...

11:02.170 --> 11:02.760
Put it...

11:11.240 --> 11:11.960
Man up.

11:16.310 --> 11:17.640
You said it is medicine.

11:18.450 --> 11:19.850
Can you take it right now?

11:20.570 --> 11:21.010
Sure.

11:21.490 --> 11:22.120
Of course.

11:30.060 --> 11:30.920
This color...

11:32.650 --> 11:33.780
This color is wrong.

11:34.580 --> 11:35.380
What's wrong?

11:36.700 --> 11:37.760
You can't drink it?

12:01.910 --> 12:02.540
I knew it.

12:04.110 --> 12:05.040
What do you mean?

12:05.790 --> 12:07.520
You have such a beautiful face

12:08.820 --> 12:10.370
but such a vicious heart.

12:14.280 --> 12:15.080
Take her away.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.320
Send her out of the valley

12:17.350 --> 12:18.230
and back to the Song family.

12:18.230 --> 12:18.630
Yes.

12:19.720 --> 12:20.410
It's not me.

12:21.170 --> 12:22.430
You've made a mistake.

12:22.470 --> 12:23.400
It's not me.

12:29.220 --> 12:30.850
We've resolved the red powder issue.

12:30.850 --> 12:32.780
It’s time to test these tea leaves.

12:33.250 --> 12:36.050
I wanted Miss Shangguan to drink them personally,

12:36.320 --> 12:37.640
but she’s not here.

12:38.750 --> 12:39.550
Interesting.

12:41.590 --> 12:42.450
Let me try.

12:47.850 --> 12:49.170
Miss Shangguan

12:49.420 --> 12:51.020
drank tea with us last night.

12:51.060 --> 12:52.520
She also drank it herself.

12:52.530 --> 12:53.560
I can testify.

12:55.010 --> 12:55.620
So,

12:56.610 --> 12:58.690
I believe these tea leaves are fine.

13:00.280 --> 13:00.980
Besides,

13:02.030 --> 13:03.630
it was indeed Miss Shangguan

13:03.810 --> 13:05.430
who cured the rash on my face.

13:07.830 --> 13:08.690
Let me do it.

13:17.990 --> 13:18.410
Wait.

13:26.580 --> 13:28.870
Since you're so frank,

13:29.500 --> 13:30.830
you don't need to drink.

13:31.980 --> 13:32.840
Sword Wielder,

13:33.070 --> 13:34.730
I don't think it's a good idea.

13:34.760 --> 13:35.890
You should be fair

13:36.040 --> 13:38.040
like holding a bowl of water evenly.

13:39.100 --> 13:40.230
This is a bowl of tea,

13:40.510 --> 13:41.570
not a bowl of water.

13:46.220 --> 13:47.820
She doesn't need to drink it,

13:48.050 --> 13:48.700
but

13:49.840 --> 13:51.770
I want to question Miss Shangguan.

13:52.900 --> 13:53.580
Why?

13:57.230 --> 13:59.430
You might not have listened carefully.

14:00.170 --> 14:02.040
All those who enter the Gong residence

14:02.040 --> 14:03.700
must be searched thoroughly.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.820
They cannot bring any medication

14:06.940 --> 14:08.540
or weaponry into the valley.

14:09.860 --> 14:11.090
Miss Yun just said

14:12.100 --> 14:13.030
that last night,

14:13.130 --> 14:15.300
she took Miss Shangguan’s ointment

14:15.340 --> 14:16.600
to relieve the rashes.

14:17.290 --> 14:17.820
So,

14:18.300 --> 14:19.860
I want to ask Miss Shangguan

14:20.550 --> 14:21.610
where her ointment

14:22.210 --> 14:23.320
came from.

14:26.980 --> 14:28.170
It's getting late.

14:29.600 --> 14:30.630
I’ll wait here.

14:32.860 --> 14:33.720
Miss Shangguan

14:34.870 --> 14:36.400
should be back soon, right?

14:38.050 --> 14:38.710
Otherwise,

14:39.290 --> 14:40.060
she might not

14:41.320 --> 14:43.320
be able to return after night falls.

15:05.120 --> 15:05.780
Don't move.

15:08.550 --> 15:09.390
Who are you?

15:15.940 --> 15:16.870
Shangguan Qian.

15:18.340 --> 15:18.970
Bride?

15:21.630 --> 15:22.070
Yes,

15:22.830 --> 15:23.420
a bride.

15:25.460 --> 15:27.120
You shouldn't have come here.

15:28.710 --> 15:29.470
I know.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.710
Then why did you come?

15:31.340 --> 15:32.200
Why

15:32.750 --> 15:33.480
are you here?

15:35.880 --> 15:37.880
Physician Zhou who checked my pulse

15:38.610 --> 15:39.990
said I have a harsh aura,

15:40.670 --> 15:41.930
and my physique is cold

15:42.470 --> 15:44.130
and humid, blocking the flow.

15:44.470 --> 15:46.460
I don't know if this is why

15:47.390 --> 15:49.120
I only got the white jade token.

15:49.910 --> 15:50.960
I came to him

15:51.190 --> 15:52.220
to see

15:52.760 --> 15:54.360
if there is any prescription

15:55.580 --> 15:57.490
that can cure my physique.

16:00.620 --> 16:03.100
Do you want to be chosen by the Sword Wielder this badly?

16:03.100 --> 16:03.940
I did before,

16:06.350 --> 16:07.180
but not anymore.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.380
Then why did you come?

16:11.570 --> 16:13.570
The doctor said humidity in the body

16:14.590 --> 16:16.270
is not conducive for childbirth.

16:16.270 --> 16:17.590
Then, what did you mean

16:18.710 --> 16:20.440
by saying you wanted to before,

16:21.230 --> 16:22.160
but not anymore?

16:23.500 --> 16:25.050
You must be

16:26.080 --> 16:27.340
Young Master Yuanzhi.

16:30.740 --> 16:31.900
In my opinion,

16:32.860 --> 16:33.640
Gong Ziyu,

16:34.520 --> 16:36.050
the current Sword Wielder,

16:37.170 --> 16:38.500
doesn't qualify at all.

16:40.620 --> 16:42.150
The most qualified one

16:43.160 --> 16:44.690
is the second young master,

16:45.220 --> 16:46.180
Gong Shangjue.

16:49.860 --> 16:51.350
Do you know me well?

17:34.220 --> 17:35.150
Miss Shangguan.

17:58.650 --> 17:59.580
Miss Shangguan.

18:00.980 --> 18:01.840
Sword Wielder.

18:03.990 --> 18:04.920
Miss Shangguan,

18:05.190 --> 18:06.150
where did you go?

18:06.850 --> 18:07.810
To the clinic.

18:08.380 --> 18:08.880
Oh?

18:09.470 --> 18:10.790
Do you feel unwell?

18:11.640 --> 18:14.180
Physician Zhou checked my pulse the other day.

18:14.180 --> 18:15.710
He said that my aura is harsh

18:16.020 --> 18:17.680
and I have humidity in my body.

18:17.850 --> 18:20.380
That's why I only received a white jade token.

18:20.500 --> 18:22.710
I went to him to ask for a prescription.

18:25.500 --> 18:26.130
Maybe

18:27.140 --> 18:28.990
then I could receive the golden token

18:28.990 --> 18:30.200
and become

18:31.000 --> 18:31.780
your bride.

18:36.230 --> 18:37.160
Miss Shangguan,

18:37.660 --> 18:40.390
the Gong residence has a very complex landscape.

18:40.390 --> 18:41.920
How did you find the clinic?

18:42.870 --> 18:43.520
Also,

18:43.980 --> 18:45.430
security was strengthened

18:45.430 --> 18:47.690
after my father and brother were killed.

18:47.980 --> 18:49.890
You managed to come and go

18:50.220 --> 18:51.550
without any obstacles.

18:51.780 --> 18:53.080
It's indeed complicated.

18:53.080 --> 18:54.170
I even got lost.

18:55.200 --> 18:56.400
Luckily, I met a girl

18:56.420 --> 18:58.500
who was going to the clinic to get medicine.

18:58.500 --> 19:00.760
I found the right place by following her.

19:01.190 --> 19:03.310
I had a lot of trouble on my way back too,

19:03.310 --> 19:04.510
so it took a long time.

19:06.780 --> 19:09.020
I don't know the rules of the Gong residence.

19:09.020 --> 19:10.450
Sword Wielder,

19:10.870 --> 19:12.400
please punish me as needed.

19:14.530 --> 19:15.730
No need to punish you.

19:16.230 --> 19:17.760
The ignorant are innocent.

19:17.830 --> 19:19.490
Just be careful in the future.

19:20.220 --> 19:21.310
If you don't understand the rules,

19:21.310 --> 19:22.440
you can ask Madam Fu.

19:26.270 --> 19:27.850
She passed so easily.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.420
Thank you, Sword Wielder.

19:33.750 --> 19:34.340
However,

19:35.360 --> 19:36.410
I have something

19:36.620 --> 19:37.930
to ask you.

19:38.870 --> 19:39.670
Please ask.

19:40.030 --> 19:41.360
I will answer what I can.

19:41.940 --> 19:43.200
Miss Jiang and Miss Yun

19:43.410 --> 19:45.470
had rashes on their faces last night.

19:46.350 --> 19:47.040
Miss Jiang

19:47.510 --> 19:48.840
even fell unconscious.

19:50.110 --> 19:51.270
Miss Yun told me

19:52.040 --> 19:52.740
that they all drank

19:52.740 --> 19:54.940
the tea you brought from your hometown.

19:55.470 --> 19:56.500
So, I wanted to ask...

19:56.500 --> 19:58.300
Sword Wielder, do you want to ask

19:58.350 --> 20:00.880
how I brought the tea into the Gong residence?

20:03.810 --> 20:05.700
It was part of my dowry

20:05.950 --> 20:07.290
and thoroughly inspected

20:07.290 --> 20:09.090
before being brought to my room.

20:09.350 --> 20:11.050
If you're worried,

20:11.430 --> 20:12.420
you can ask the ones

20:12.420 --> 20:14.150
in charge of the brides' dowry.

20:15.840 --> 20:16.390
Besides,

20:16.640 --> 20:17.780
I also drank the tea.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.010
Yes.

20:20.070 --> 20:20.950
Miss Yun

20:21.300 --> 20:22.840
has testified for you.

20:26.810 --> 20:27.940
Thank you, Miss Yun.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.930
Miss Yun wants to thank you too.

20:38.000 --> 20:38.740
Miss Yun,

20:39.540 --> 20:40.470
what do you mean?

20:42.140 --> 20:43.600
Miss Yun wants to thank you

20:44.260 --> 20:46.720
because she used your family's ointment

20:47.730 --> 20:49.120
to relieve the rash.

20:51.320 --> 20:51.950
However,

20:53.800 --> 20:55.100
tea can be brought in

20:56.090 --> 20:57.180
to the Gong residence

20:57.180 --> 20:58.380
as long as it's proven

20:59.510 --> 21:00.960
to be harmless.

21:01.950 --> 21:03.280
But there are two things

21:03.550 --> 21:05.860
that can never be brought in.

21:06.990 --> 21:08.850
That is medication and weaponry.

21:10.000 --> 21:12.460
The ointment is a strictly controlled item.

21:13.420 --> 21:14.390
Miss Shangguan,

21:15.540 --> 21:16.910
how did you bring it in?

21:21.170 --> 21:21.970
On my body.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.480
I brought it in on my body.

21:29.550 --> 21:30.230
Later,

21:30.460 --> 21:31.470
Miss Shangguan,

21:32.030 --> 21:34.380
please give the remaining ointment to the guards

21:34.380 --> 21:37.510
and ask them to take them back to the clinic for research.

21:37.870 --> 21:39.720
If it's really harmless,

21:40.850 --> 21:41.930
it doesn't matter.

21:42.700 --> 21:43.610
I just hope

21:43.860 --> 21:45.060
you won't do it again.

21:47.050 --> 21:47.740
But

21:48.500 --> 21:51.160
if there is something wrong with this ointment,

21:52.140 --> 21:53.650
I’ll come to you again.

21:56.860 --> 21:58.420
Even if it’s harmless,

21:58.460 --> 21:59.700
it's taboo in the Gong residence.

21:59.700 --> 22:00.630
It can't be fine.

22:02.220 --> 22:03.370
I said it's fine.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.220
Oh, dear.

22:05.750 --> 22:07.510
Thank you for your mercy.

22:41.830 --> 22:42.630
What's wrong?

22:44.080 --> 22:46.140
Did you really go to the clinic today?

22:46.420 --> 22:46.730
Yes.

22:47.530 --> 22:49.460
You really went to see a physician?

22:49.670 --> 22:50.570
No.

22:51.390 --> 22:53.960
I made up the cold and humidity.

22:54.750 --> 22:55.830
Like you,

22:56.220 --> 22:57.150
I took medicine for several months

22:57.150 --> 22:58.720
while I was in Wufeng.

22:59.420 --> 23:01.350
My body has already been adjusted.

23:02.420 --> 23:05.070
I went to the clinic to look for Gong Yuanzhi.

23:06.810 --> 23:08.390
I didn't expect

23:08.950 --> 23:10.870
to run into Gong Shangjue instead.

23:10.870 --> 23:12.780
So, your target is Gong Shangjue.

23:14.960 --> 23:16.090
You're quite smart.

23:17.730 --> 23:19.160
Among the Gong family,

23:19.460 --> 23:22.310
Young Master Shangjue is the most difficult to manage.

23:22.310 --> 23:24.220
Everyone in the Gong family is difficult.

23:24.220 --> 23:25.040
Is that so?

23:26.750 --> 23:28.640
I saw that Gong Ziyu

23:29.040 --> 23:30.270
kept staring at you.

23:31.620 --> 23:32.940
You have a hold on him, right?

23:32.940 --> 23:33.470
Yes.

23:36.680 --> 23:37.370
I think so.

23:40.060 --> 23:40.920
What about you?

23:41.700 --> 23:42.420
Me too,

23:43.470 --> 23:45.970
especially after I saw Gong Shangjue today.

23:46.770 --> 23:48.500
I think I'm more confident now.

23:58.610 --> 24:00.610
Gong Shangjue didn't say anything

24:01.030 --> 24:02.860
after seeing my jade token,

24:03.570 --> 24:04.580
but I know

24:05.360 --> 24:07.390
it must have aroused his curiosity.

24:09.620 --> 24:12.270
Curiosity is the biggest bait.

24:14.430 --> 24:15.980
He won't let me go.

24:17.390 --> 24:18.720
What is this jade token?

24:27.030 --> 24:27.630
By the way,

24:29.510 --> 24:30.980
tell me in advance

24:31.990 --> 24:33.590
the next time you have a plan.

24:33.840 --> 24:35.690
If something like today happens again,

24:35.690 --> 24:37.220
I won't know how to help you.

24:38.140 --> 24:38.940
Help me?

24:40.140 --> 24:41.970
You think that telling Gong Ziyu I have an ointment

24:41.970 --> 24:44.430
and having him investigate me is helping me?

24:47.010 --> 24:48.730
With our identities,

24:49.150 --> 24:49.820
do you think

24:50.660 --> 24:52.740
it's better for everyone in the Gong residence

24:52.740 --> 24:55.140
to think that we're very close to each other

24:55.660 --> 24:56.930
or are enemies?

24:57.220 --> 24:58.060
It's better to make people think

24:58.060 --> 24:58.860
we hate each other

24:58.860 --> 25:01.040
and want to kill each other.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.490
The enemy of my enemy...

25:05.700 --> 25:06.690
Is my friend.

25:10.390 --> 25:11.860
You're risking your life.

25:15.430 --> 25:17.130
This is the best solution now,

25:19.300 --> 25:19.950
isn't it?

25:21.920 --> 25:23.330
My target is Gong Ziyu.

25:24.060 --> 25:25.720
Your target is Gong Shangjue.

25:26.590 --> 25:28.120
To win their trust,

25:28.750 --> 25:29.740
we must

25:30.850 --> 25:32.710
first acknowledge their enemies

25:33.180 --> 25:34.460
and stand with them.

25:35.950 --> 25:37.680
Gong Shangjue has always been

25:37.700 --> 25:39.300
the most popular successor.

25:39.590 --> 25:40.320
Also,

25:40.360 --> 25:42.970
he has been suspicious of Gong Ziyu's lineage.

25:43.980 --> 25:45.360
Thus, he and Gong Ziyu

25:45.910 --> 25:47.770
will definitely become enemies.

25:48.790 --> 25:50.640
If Gong Ziyu really chooses me,

25:51.460 --> 25:53.390
and Gong Shangjue keeps you...

25:53.620 --> 25:55.130
Gong Ziyu will definitely not give up

25:55.130 --> 25:56.660
on researching the brides,

25:57.270 --> 25:59.330
so he'll definitely investigate me.

25:59.980 --> 26:01.290
On the contrary,

26:01.940 --> 26:04.740
Gong Shangjue definitely won't let you go either.

26:10.450 --> 26:11.540
So, you and I

26:12.800 --> 26:14.230
must become enemies.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.310
The more we fight,

26:19.180 --> 26:20.640
the more they'll trust us.

26:28.740 --> 26:29.740
Let's fight then.

26:30.840 --> 26:31.410
Weishan,

26:32.330 --> 26:33.390
please show mercy.

26:34.600 --> 26:35.440
Do we have it?

26:40.230 --> 26:40.860
What?

26:43.870 --> 26:44.390
Mercy.

26:47.820 --> 26:48.750
You just asked me

26:49.220 --> 26:50.420
to show mercy,

26:53.930 --> 26:54.960
but do we have it?

27:06.470 --> 27:07.200
Yun Weishan.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.860
If we are both chosen at the end,

27:13.700 --> 27:14.750
our future

27:16.150 --> 27:17.480
will be very difficult.

27:56.210 --> 27:56.900
Halt.

27:59.110 --> 27:59.840
Jin Fan.

28:01.950 --> 28:03.010
Eldest Young Miss.

28:03.710 --> 28:04.310
Come here.

28:09.530 --> 28:10.960
It's not dawn yet.

28:11.440 --> 28:12.870
The rooster hasn't crowed yet.

28:12.870 --> 28:14.000
Where are you going?

28:14.610 --> 28:15.270
The clinic.

28:16.500 --> 28:17.900
The clinic is over there.

28:18.250 --> 28:19.380
Where are you going?

28:19.720 --> 28:20.940
It's okay. I'll take a detour.

28:20.940 --> 28:22.070
I won't disturb you.

28:22.220 --> 28:23.220
What a loser.

28:23.460 --> 28:24.550
As a man,

28:24.670 --> 28:26.350
there are only some difficulties...

28:26.350 --> 28:26.920
Oh no,

28:27.990 --> 28:29.080
some surprises

28:30.070 --> 28:32.130
and you're afraid to face it head-on.

28:32.220 --> 28:32.610
No,

28:33.850 --> 28:35.110
to welcome it head-on.

28:35.430 --> 28:37.490
Your good looks are a waste.

28:38.010 --> 28:40.140
What does this have to do with my looks?

28:44.460 --> 28:45.030
Stop!

28:49.460 --> 28:50.920
I need to go somewhere too.

28:51.120 --> 28:52.250
Where are you going?

28:52.990 --> 28:53.810
The clinic.

29:01.750 --> 29:02.480
Herb Elixir.

29:20.030 --> 29:20.780
How is it?

29:22.570 --> 29:24.970
These two pills look identical at a glance,

29:25.020 --> 29:26.390
but the one we just took out

29:26.390 --> 29:28.120
has a smooth, glowing surface.

29:28.300 --> 29:31.300
The Young Lord and former Sword Wielder's Herb Elixir

29:31.490 --> 29:33.290
is slightly rougher and darker.

29:34.750 --> 29:35.420
Smooth.

29:37.960 --> 29:38.870
Rough.

29:41.320 --> 29:42.120
What is this?

29:42.310 --> 29:43.310
It's to warm it up.

29:49.240 --> 29:51.370
This is what the Young Lord had before.

29:51.580 --> 29:52.250
Hey.

29:55.780 --> 29:57.380
Since you can't see clearly,

29:58.130 --> 29:59.990
and can't feel it with your hands,

30:00.230 --> 30:02.270
let the poison go through my body

30:02.790 --> 30:04.520
and leave the truth in my heart.

30:04.680 --> 30:06.140
Only if you take the poison

30:06.340 --> 30:08.340
-can you reach the top.
-Spit it out.

30:09.660 --> 30:11.220
It's just like what I usually eat.

30:11.220 --> 30:12.420
It tastes quite good.

30:14.620 --> 30:15.750
Go get me a cup of tea.

30:30.190 --> 30:31.800
Are you sure no one will find out?

30:31.800 --> 30:33.650
It's not a small issue to import the wrong herbs.

30:33.650 --> 30:34.110
Shut up!

30:34.450 --> 30:35.790
Keep your mouth shut.

30:37.500 --> 30:38.310
Burn it all.

30:38.670 --> 30:39.130
Yes.

30:40.810 --> 30:41.740
Burn the bag too.

30:48.100 --> 30:49.430
What are you eating now?

30:50.980 --> 30:52.850
Since it's hard to tell whether it's real or not,

30:52.850 --> 30:54.510
we can only test the medicine.

30:55.030 --> 30:56.650
I found some poisonous herbs

30:56.900 --> 30:57.810
to eat.

30:58.500 --> 30:59.760
You're too reckless.

30:59.780 --> 31:00.870
If I'm fine,

31:01.150 --> 31:01.780
it means

31:01.780 --> 31:04.490
there's nothing wrong with the Young Lord and Sword Wielder's Herb Elixir.

31:04.490 --> 31:05.600
If I'm poisoned,

31:06.290 --> 31:07.130
remember,

31:08.790 --> 31:10.370
I died for you.

31:11.820 --> 31:12.480
Spit it out.

31:20.200 --> 31:21.400
Are you really angry?

31:22.740 --> 31:23.620
I lied to you.

31:23.640 --> 31:24.970
How could I take poison?

31:25.240 --> 31:27.510
The Gong family doesn't place poison in the clinic.

31:27.510 --> 31:28.310
The front hall

31:28.310 --> 31:30.440
only contains some functional pills.

31:30.930 --> 31:32.870
Not only can the Herb Elixir prevent poison,

31:32.870 --> 31:34.440
it can also make some functional pills

31:34.440 --> 31:35.640
lose effectiveness.

31:41.860 --> 31:43.190
Were you worried for me?

31:44.210 --> 31:45.540
I was worried you'd die.

31:45.740 --> 31:47.140
You were worried I'd die?

31:48.220 --> 31:49.020
I understand.

31:49.710 --> 31:50.970
You're so sweet.

31:52.420 --> 31:53.500
If you died here,

31:53.910 --> 31:55.770
what would I say to Gong Shangliu?

31:56.060 --> 31:57.190
You're lying.

32:03.470 --> 32:04.400
Bird's Song.

32:04.860 --> 32:06.620
This pill will affect one's vocal chords,

32:06.620 --> 32:08.680
making one's voice narrow and sharp.

32:08.850 --> 32:11.050
Men use it when disguising themselves.

32:11.540 --> 32:12.940
Women should not take it.

32:16.870 --> 32:18.010
Does that mean

32:18.180 --> 32:19.520
the Young Lord and Sword Wielder's Herb Elixir

32:19.520 --> 32:22.120
was replaced with ineffective fake medicine?

32:23.600 --> 32:26.810
Then my sacrifice is worth it.

32:29.670 --> 32:30.930
Do you smell...

32:31.410 --> 32:33.470
-My body fragrance?
-A pungent odor?

32:54.200 --> 32:54.540
Stop.

32:56.010 --> 32:57.010
What do this mean?

32:57.270 --> 32:58.280
It means "stop."

32:58.860 --> 32:59.920
You already said it.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.380
Why did you do the gesture?

33:01.660 --> 33:03.860
Why did you say it if you did the gesture?

33:09.220 --> 33:10.150
Wait for me here.

33:10.380 --> 33:10.990
Okay.

33:15.860 --> 33:16.920
What are you doing?

33:17.270 --> 33:18.340
Guardian Jin.

33:18.670 --> 33:20.560
I-I'm burning expired herbs.

33:20.900 --> 33:21.700
Expired herbs

33:21.700 --> 33:23.710
are shipped out and destroyed by specified personnel.

33:23.710 --> 33:24.700
How could they be burned

33:24.700 --> 33:26.240
in the clinic for no reason?

33:26.740 --> 33:28.570
These herbs...

33:38.420 --> 33:39.910
[Ethereal]

33:46.550 --> 33:48.150
Thank you, Young Master Jin.

33:48.310 --> 33:50.310
You even prepared a surprise for me.

33:50.330 --> 33:52.070
This is our token of love.

33:52.330 --> 33:53.790
This is the case evidence.

34:12.409 --> 34:14.139
According to the medical book,

34:14.440 --> 34:16.370
this is indeed an Ethereal Flower.

34:17.449 --> 34:20.710
Then why did the clinic's servant act so suspiciously,

34:21.120 --> 34:23.520
as if they were trying to destroy evidence?

34:29.739 --> 34:30.510
How come I didn't know

34:30.510 --> 34:32.110
that you're familiar with pharmacology

34:32.110 --> 34:33.510
in addition to weaponry?

34:34.210 --> 34:34.900
I don't.

34:42.630 --> 34:44.290
None of us know pharmacology.

34:45.260 --> 34:46.880
The Gong residence's antidote and drug production

34:46.880 --> 34:48.409
have also been managed by the Zhi Lineage.

34:48.409 --> 34:49.340
But Gong Yuanzhi

34:49.800 --> 34:50.929
would never help me.

34:56.560 --> 34:57.040
I...

35:03.240 --> 35:04.000
I...

35:04.500 --> 35:05.530
I like you too.

35:09.140 --> 35:11.340
I know someone who knows pharmacology.

35:18.770 --> 35:19.630
Lord Sword Wielder,

35:19.630 --> 35:21.630
the three elders request a meeting.

35:36.580 --> 35:37.710
Greetings, elders.

35:38.200 --> 35:38.800
Ziyu.

35:40.150 --> 35:42.940
According to etiquette, you should mourn your parents

35:42.940 --> 35:44.120
for three years.

35:44.900 --> 35:45.880
No marriage,

35:46.790 --> 35:48.320
drinking or celebrations.

35:49.240 --> 35:51.560
We should have sent all the brides-to-be

35:51.680 --> 35:53.280
back to their hometowns

35:53.550 --> 35:55.080
and apologized with gifts.

35:55.270 --> 35:55.900
But

35:56.300 --> 35:58.300
considering the changes this time,

35:58.590 --> 35:59.450
and that Wufeng

35:59.520 --> 36:02.140
has also figured out how to enter the Gong residence,

36:02.140 --> 36:03.000
we believe

36:03.660 --> 36:05.520
for a long period into the future,

36:05.840 --> 36:09.240
it won't be suitable to marry a bride from outside the valley.

36:09.430 --> 36:10.020
So,

36:10.210 --> 36:11.270
after discussing,

36:11.740 --> 36:12.270
we hope

36:12.350 --> 36:13.420
the Lord Sword Wielder

36:13.420 --> 36:15.840
can choose someone you fancy

36:16.030 --> 36:18.030
among the girls brought in this time

36:18.340 --> 36:20.470
and keep her by your side temporarily.

36:21.070 --> 36:22.060
Later, we'll find

36:22.060 --> 36:23.390
another auspicious day

36:23.780 --> 36:25.240
for the official wedding.

36:26.430 --> 36:26.820
Yes.

36:32.370 --> 36:33.080
Shangjue,

36:34.560 --> 36:36.360
you are also of age for marriage.

36:36.870 --> 36:37.620
How about

36:38.210 --> 36:40.370
you choose together?

36:40.900 --> 36:41.260
Fine.

36:41.860 --> 36:45.020
The marriage selection was set for the former Young Lord.

36:45.020 --> 36:46.950
I've been extremely busy these past few years.

36:46.950 --> 36:48.680
I didn't intend to get married.

36:49.150 --> 36:50.410
But the recent changes

36:51.020 --> 36:52.490
made me reconsider.

36:54.620 --> 36:57.240
The Gong family's lineage has always been sparse.

36:57.240 --> 36:57.970
In addition,

36:58.120 --> 36:59.700
various signs show

37:00.790 --> 37:02.650
that Wufeng has started plotting

37:03.060 --> 37:04.720
to attack the Gong residence.

37:07.160 --> 37:08.290
This is a good thing.

37:09.190 --> 37:09.850
Good things

37:10.240 --> 37:11.040
come in pairs.

37:12.890 --> 37:13.670
Ziyu,

37:14.470 --> 37:15.470
what do you think?

37:21.880 --> 37:23.340
If you wish to get married,

37:23.560 --> 37:25.220
that is naturally great news.

37:25.870 --> 37:26.540
However,

37:28.100 --> 37:29.650
you've always had high standards

37:29.650 --> 37:30.710
and a unique taste.

37:31.310 --> 37:31.960
I wonder

37:33.180 --> 37:34.980
if you're willing to compromise

37:35.740 --> 37:37.380
with a girl that I pass over?

37:39.970 --> 37:40.680
Ziyu,

37:42.240 --> 37:43.500
I never compromise

37:44.360 --> 37:45.700
for anything.

37:49.840 --> 37:51.560
Help me keep Miss Shangguan.

38:02.230 --> 38:03.090
Sword Wielder,

38:03.620 --> 38:07.110
do you also want to choose Miss Shangguan?

38:25.320 --> 38:26.520
Miss Shangguan Qian,

38:27.130 --> 38:29.130
please go to the Sword Wielder Hall.

38:35.530 --> 38:36.590
Lord Sword Wielder

38:37.210 --> 38:38.490
chose Miss Shangguan?

38:39.270 --> 38:40.740
What about us?

38:56.200 --> 38:57.370
Miss Yun Weishan,

38:58.050 --> 39:00.050
please go to the Sword Wielder Hall.

39:23.590 --> 39:24.650
They have arrived.

39:25.460 --> 39:26.150
Guards,

39:26.300 --> 39:27.100
you may leave.

39:28.950 --> 39:29.210
Yes.

40:05.500 --> 40:06.300
Guardian Jin,

40:06.460 --> 40:08.120
you can't enter the back hill.

40:09.260 --> 40:09.840
I know.

40:11.650 --> 40:14.110
Please bring this token to Young Master Yue.

40:14.870 --> 40:15.580
Tell him

40:15.810 --> 40:18.270
that a Jade Guardian is waiting for him here.

40:23.080 --> 40:24.230
The Sword Wielder

40:24.550 --> 40:26.730
and Young Master Shangjue

40:26.780 --> 40:28.640
have chosen their future brides.

40:28.860 --> 40:29.530
Then,

40:29.630 --> 40:32.220
Miss Yun Weishan and Shangguan Qian

40:32.680 --> 40:35.010
can become attendants starting tonight

40:35.300 --> 40:37.360
and reside in the Jue and Yu Lineages.

40:37.820 --> 40:38.900
No need to rush.

40:42.970 --> 40:44.370
This marriage selection

40:44.500 --> 40:45.740
was used by the Wufeng

40:46.750 --> 40:49.480
to help assassins infiltrate the Gong residence

40:49.990 --> 40:52.320
and kill the Sword Wielder and Young Lord.

40:52.910 --> 40:55.310
Although we've found one Wufeng assassin,

40:57.440 --> 40:59.000
there might be another one.

41:00.760 --> 41:02.230
That's why

41:02.970 --> 41:04.370
I chose Miss Yun Weishan.

41:06.310 --> 41:07.440
Lord Sword Wielder,

41:07.990 --> 41:09.150
what do you mean?

41:11.060 --> 41:12.700
When I tested the brides that night

41:12.700 --> 41:15.070
by bringing them away from the Underground Palace,

41:15.070 --> 41:16.000
Miss Yun Weishan

41:16.540 --> 41:18.800
tried to escape from the Gong residence.

41:18.950 --> 41:20.300
I met her again yesterday.

41:20.300 --> 41:22.030
She wanted to escape yet again.

41:22.630 --> 41:23.870
Someone who tries so hard

41:23.870 --> 41:25.000
to leave this place

41:25.780 --> 41:26.440
would never

41:26.620 --> 41:27.740
be a Wufeng spy

41:27.820 --> 41:29.560
that worked hard to sneak in.

41:30.590 --> 41:31.140
But...

41:31.980 --> 41:33.030
Shangjue,

41:33.700 --> 41:35.360
how did you choose your bride?

41:36.790 --> 41:37.690
Is it just because

41:37.690 --> 41:39.150
Miss Shangguan is pretty?

41:42.340 --> 41:44.750
I didn't even notice before you mentioned it.

41:44.750 --> 41:45.880
Ziyu, it turns out

41:46.730 --> 41:49.990
that you've paid attention to Miss Shangguan's features.

41:57.580 --> 41:58.320
Elders,

41:59.350 --> 42:00.800
no matter what reasons

42:00.820 --> 42:02.060
Ziyu and I have,

42:03.380 --> 42:04.540
to be sure,

42:06.110 --> 42:07.180
I've already arranged for artists

42:07.180 --> 42:08.910
to draw their portraits later.

42:09.580 --> 42:10.190
Then,

42:10.460 --> 42:12.790
I will send men to Yun Weishan's hometown,

42:12.900 --> 42:13.590
Lixi Town,

42:13.780 --> 42:15.910
and the Shangguan family in Dafu City.

42:16.260 --> 42:17.460
They will verify

42:17.840 --> 42:19.170
the ladies' identities

42:19.330 --> 42:20.730
with the local neighbors

42:21.090 --> 42:22.250
and relatives.

42:25.460 --> 42:26.460
Coincidentally,

42:27.080 --> 42:27.940
Lixi Town

42:28.690 --> 42:30.150
is very close to Dafu City.

42:31.260 --> 42:32.590
Only one trip is needed.

42:34.580 --> 42:35.310
Elders,

42:36.070 --> 42:37.250
and Ziyu,

42:38.020 --> 42:39.850
I believe that it's not too much

42:40.520 --> 42:41.910
to be cautious

42:42.620 --> 42:44.350
in these extraordinary times.

42:46.590 --> 42:47.190
Of course.

42:47.750 --> 42:48.350
Of course.

42:50.140 --> 42:50.880
So,

42:51.630 --> 42:52.640
I ask you two

42:53.150 --> 42:54.750
to stay in the side residence

42:55.390 --> 42:56.570
for the time being.

42:58.990 --> 43:00.440
I will arrange more guards

43:00.440 --> 43:01.770
to protect your safety.

43:02.580 --> 43:04.050
If nothing goes wrong,

43:06.420 --> 43:07.740
you'll become family.

43:10.500 --> 43:12.430
Thank you, Young Master Shangjue.

43:15.060 --> 43:17.470
Dafu City is a bit far from here.

43:18.060 --> 43:18.810
It seems

43:19.110 --> 43:20.260
we will have to stay in the side residence

43:20.260 --> 43:21.710
for quite some time.

43:22.430 --> 43:25.760
We couldn't bring any daily necessities into the mountain.

43:26.170 --> 43:26.800
May we

43:27.280 --> 43:28.670
leave the Gong residence

43:28.670 --> 43:30.220
to buy some items in town?

43:30.260 --> 43:32.390
If you need anything,

43:33.520 --> 43:35.330
just ask the servants to buy them

43:36.900 --> 43:39.360
and it will be done within the hour.

43:39.860 --> 43:41.860
No need to personally make the trip.

43:42.850 --> 43:43.540
Besides,

43:44.210 --> 43:46.860
I've already prepared the fastest men and horse

43:46.860 --> 43:48.290
with the fastest pigeon.

43:49.510 --> 43:50.510
We will have news

43:51.880 --> 43:52.940
within three days.

44:02.210 --> 44:04.900
[Be Upright]

44:34.350 --> 44:36.750
Although we've found one Wufeng assassin,

44:37.520 --> 44:39.060
there might be a second one.

44:59.450 --> 45:00.380
We will have news

45:01.830 --> 45:02.890
within three days.

45:08.210 --> 45:11.140
Eldest Young Miss and Brother Yuanzhi have arrived.

45:11.150 --> 45:13.280
I ask the elders to stay a while longer.

45:13.360 --> 45:14.470
I have something important

45:14.470 --> 45:15.600
to discuss with you.

45:15.950 --> 45:17.650
The three elders are old.

45:18.070 --> 45:19.470
Let them go back and rest.

45:20.440 --> 45:21.490
You can tell me

45:21.700 --> 45:23.030
if there are any issues.

45:23.720 --> 45:26.220
Although I'm still young and inexperienced,

45:26.220 --> 45:27.950
I'm already the Sword Wielder.

45:28.300 --> 45:29.370
Young Master Shangjue,

45:29.370 --> 45:30.830
please mind your manners.

45:33.210 --> 45:34.280
This is exactly

45:35.060 --> 45:36.320
what I wish to discuss.

45:38.290 --> 45:39.510
You must have noticed

45:40.580 --> 45:42.260
I haven't called you "Sword Wielder"

45:42.260 --> 45:44.350
since you came in, right?

45:45.690 --> 45:47.690
If you want me to call you that title,

45:48.380 --> 45:49.220
Ziyu,

45:50.180 --> 45:51.110
it won't be easy.

45:51.440 --> 45:52.640
It's not hard either.

45:56.070 --> 45:57.730
The elders are all here today.

45:58.190 --> 45:59.360
What I want to say is

45:59.990 --> 46:00.990
I, Gong Shangjue,

46:01.460 --> 46:02.390
don't recognize

46:03.060 --> 46:04.410
and even oppose of

46:05.200 --> 46:07.330
Gong Ziyu being the new Sword Wielder.

46:12.810 --> 46:13.820
There must be a reason

46:13.820 --> 46:14.910
why you object.

46:15.480 --> 46:18.580
Gong Ziyu meets the conditions for succession in the absence of an heir.

46:18.580 --> 46:19.430
Could it be

46:19.930 --> 46:21.420
that you want to go against

46:21.440 --> 46:23.770
the ancestral precept of the Gong family?

46:24.030 --> 46:24.990
No one

46:25.140 --> 46:27.140
can violate the ancestral precept,

46:27.340 --> 46:28.580
but does Gong Ziyu

46:29.380 --> 46:30.980
really meet the conditions?

46:32.870 --> 46:34.650
I've copied the ancestral precept more than 30 times.

46:34.650 --> 46:35.910
I remember it clearly.

46:36.650 --> 46:37.910
Since you've copied it so many times,

46:37.910 --> 46:39.240
why don't you recite it?

46:43.520 --> 46:46.460
The successor must have become of age.

46:46.880 --> 46:47.740
In this regard,

46:47.760 --> 46:49.960
Brother Gong Yuanzhi isn't qualified.

46:50.910 --> 46:51.460
Second,

46:51.730 --> 46:53.330
the successor must be a man.

46:53.450 --> 46:54.270
I don't qualify

46:54.270 --> 46:55.160
for this.

46:55.790 --> 46:56.400
Third,

46:56.630 --> 46:57.720
the successor

46:57.740 --> 47:00.180
must be a descendant of and present in the Gong residence.

47:00.180 --> 47:00.890
For this,

47:00.910 --> 47:01.960
Gong Shangjue,

47:01.980 --> 47:04.440
who was outside the valley and unreachable at the time,

47:04.440 --> 47:05.930
doesn't qualify.

47:07.950 --> 47:09.550
You've counted it yourself.

47:10.010 --> 47:12.190
The successor must meet four conditions.

47:12.190 --> 47:13.320
Were you listening?

47:13.560 --> 47:14.480
Of age,

47:14.630 --> 47:15.280
male,

47:15.300 --> 47:16.390
and present in the Gong residence

47:16.390 --> 47:17.650
are only three points.

47:19.140 --> 47:20.940
The point of the third condition

47:21.600 --> 47:23.530
is not being in the Gong residence,

47:24.840 --> 47:27.170
but being a descendant of the Gong family.

47:28.430 --> 47:30.030
Just say what you want to say.

47:30.030 --> 47:31.330
My brother means

47:31.660 --> 47:34.720
that if Gong Ziyu is not a descendant of the Gong family,

47:34.730 --> 47:36.190
then his succession right

47:37.020 --> 47:38.110
is ridiculous.

47:39.230 --> 47:40.020
Gong Yuanzhi,

47:40.020 --> 47:41.280
don't speak nonsense.

47:41.870 --> 47:43.180
Who are you?

47:43.780 --> 47:45.580
Are you qualified to speak here?

47:47.840 --> 47:49.600
I think many people here know

47:49.900 --> 47:51.830
that Gong Ziyu was born prematurely

47:51.830 --> 47:52.830
before 10 months.

47:53.300 --> 47:55.420
It's always been rumored that Lady Lan

47:55.420 --> 47:57.460
had an inseparable lover before marrying

47:57.460 --> 47:58.620
into the Gong family.

47:58.620 --> 48:01.180
So, was Gong Ziyu really born prematurely,

48:01.320 --> 48:02.650
or was he a normal birth?

48:03.590 --> 48:05.110
It's hard to say.

48:05.550 --> 48:06.350
Gong Yuanzhi.

48:06.390 --> 48:06.830
Sword Wielder.

48:06.830 --> 48:08.380
Do not fight in the Hall.

48:08.400 --> 48:08.850
Shangjue,

48:08.850 --> 48:10.110
control your brother.

48:13.380 --> 48:14.850
Gong Shangjue, are you crazy?

48:14.850 --> 48:15.360
Enough!

48:15.920 --> 48:16.700
Ridiculous!

48:28.990 --> 48:30.420
It's fine for you to be lawless

48:30.420 --> 48:32.250
and disrespect the ancestral precept any other time,

48:32.250 --> 48:34.180
but the three elders are here today

48:34.180 --> 48:35.710
and you still dare to fight?

48:38.110 --> 48:39.580
Gong Yuanzhi is not yet an adult.

48:39.580 --> 48:40.980
He is reckless and ignorant.

48:40.980 --> 48:42.040
He can be forgiven.

48:43.080 --> 48:43.760
But you,

48:44.340 --> 48:45.000
Gong Ziyu,

48:45.190 --> 48:46.740
you hurt your own family.

48:47.430 --> 48:48.520
Whether it's your identity,

48:48.520 --> 48:49.200
your ability,

48:49.200 --> 48:49.800
or virtue,

48:50.100 --> 48:51.430
you don't have any of it.

48:51.860 --> 48:52.890
How can you say

48:53.440 --> 48:54.970
you deserve this position?

48:57.180 --> 48:58.750
I must kill the one

48:59.550 --> 49:00.580
who killed my father and brother.

49:00.580 --> 49:01.440
Sword Wielder,

49:01.670 --> 49:03.130
do not say such harsh words

49:03.420 --> 49:04.750
if there is no evidence.

49:04.970 --> 49:06.250
You are framing someone

49:06.250 --> 49:07.310
without evidence.

49:08.590 --> 49:09.950
You don't deserve to be the Sword Wielder.

49:09.950 --> 49:11.410
Of course I have evidence.

49:12.090 --> 49:13.210
And Gong Shangjue,

49:14.300 --> 49:15.560
you are also involved.

49:15.980 --> 49:17.180
What's wrong with me?

49:17.260 --> 49:19.700
You were the last person my father met that night.

49:19.700 --> 49:21.030
What did you talk about?

49:21.340 --> 49:22.800
Why were you in such a hurry

49:22.910 --> 49:24.310
that you left overnight?

49:24.970 --> 49:26.060
Where did you go?

49:26.230 --> 49:26.990
What did you do?

49:26.990 --> 49:27.740
Did anyone see it?

49:27.740 --> 49:28.800
Can you explain it?

49:29.340 --> 49:30.710
Of course I can.

49:31.590 --> 49:32.250
Naturally,

49:32.870 --> 49:34.600
there are also people who know,

49:34.820 --> 49:36.080
but it's confidential

49:36.990 --> 49:39.520
and ordered personally by the Sword Wielder.

49:40.870 --> 49:42.600
I don't need to report it to you.

49:44.060 --> 49:45.320
I am the Sword Wielder.

49:45.870 --> 49:46.570
I order you

49:46.820 --> 49:48.420
to report to me immediately.

49:53.900 --> 49:54.990
If you don't,

49:55.350 --> 49:56.370
you and Gong Yuanzhi

49:56.370 --> 49:59.170
will be the suspects who plotted to kill my father.

50:01.560 --> 50:03.750
If I had the intention to usurp power,

50:05.070 --> 50:08.000
I would have stayed in the Gong residence that night.

50:08.370 --> 50:10.100
If I were in the Gong residence,

50:11.920 --> 50:13.320
you'd never have a chance

50:13.810 --> 50:15.550
to be the Sword Wielder.

50:18.090 --> 50:19.230
Do not blame others

50:19.750 --> 50:20.880
if you fail at a task.

50:21.860 --> 50:24.660
If you can't live up to the Sword Wielder position,

50:25.110 --> 50:27.320
then don't accuse others of treason.

50:30.970 --> 50:32.190
I'll show you

50:33.140 --> 50:35.800
if I'm capable of being the Sword Wielder or not.

51:22.460 --> 51:23.950
Don't be angry.

51:24.790 --> 51:25.900
You know

51:25.900 --> 51:26.780
that Shangjue and Yuanzhi

51:26.780 --> 51:29.390
have always been like this.

51:29.940 --> 51:31.280
The older one has an emotionless face.

51:31.280 --> 51:33.410
The younger one has emotionless eyes.

51:48.710 --> 51:49.570
Sword Wielder,

51:49.700 --> 51:51.300
the person I mentioned who can help us

51:51.300 --> 51:53.190
identity the herb will be here soon.

51:53.190 --> 51:53.650
Okay.

51:55.100 --> 51:55.770
Later,

51:56.550 --> 51:58.270
don't ask who he is

51:58.670 --> 51:59.660
or ask me

52:00.140 --> 52:01.570
where I found him.

52:02.580 --> 52:04.240
But his words can definitely be trusted

52:04.240 --> 52:05.840
and he won't harm you either.

52:06.070 --> 52:07.730
Where else could he come from?

52:08.120 --> 52:09.470
The Gong residence is only so big.

52:09.470 --> 52:10.180
He's either from the clinic

52:10.180 --> 52:11.910
or from Gong Yuanzhi's palace.

52:12.810 --> 52:14.010
Hurry and call him in.

52:20.710 --> 52:23.980
I've never realized that he dilly-dallies like this.

52:26.150 --> 52:28.920
I think I've lost interest in him.

52:29.990 --> 52:31.590
If you go to the Guardian Camp

52:31.630 --> 52:33.140
and peek at him bathing twice,

52:33.140 --> 52:35.140
I promise you'll be interested again.

52:35.140 --> 52:36.670
Don't slander me.

52:36.670 --> 52:37.830
-I only went there once.
-I didn't slander you.

52:37.830 --> 52:38.690
Sword Wielder.

52:48.330 --> 52:48.990
Who are you?

52:51.590 --> 52:52.790
You agreed not to ask.

52:55.830 --> 52:56.690
Sword Wielder,

52:57.620 --> 52:58.620
my surname is Yue.

53:01.590 --> 53:02.890
Yue as in "mountains"?

53:03.660 --> 53:05.320
Yue as in "the romantic moon."

53:06.690 --> 53:07.690
Young Master Yue.

53:08.480 --> 53:09.690
Brother Yue.

53:13.980 --> 53:15.720
I may be much older

53:16.140 --> 53:17.200
than your brother.

53:17.630 --> 53:20.620
Young Master Yue looks younger than Jin Fan.

53:21.020 --> 53:22.300
How old can you be?

53:22.670 --> 53:24.590
If you insist on calling yourself old,

53:24.590 --> 53:27.320
I'll call you the old Matchmaking God in the moon.

53:40.910 --> 53:41.910
Young Master Yue,

53:43.280 --> 53:44.340
please take a look.

53:44.940 --> 53:45.660
Is this

53:45.950 --> 53:48.830
the most important ingredient of the Herb Elixir,

53:49.200 --> 53:50.400
the Ethereal Flower?

53:56.850 --> 53:58.650
This is not the Ethereal Flower.

53:59.460 --> 54:00.520
It is a Spirit Herb.

54:08.890 --> 54:10.750
If the Ethereal Flower is changed

54:12.020 --> 54:13.110
into a Spirit Herb

54:13.260 --> 54:14.430
in the ingredients,

54:14.750 --> 54:15.950
would the Herb Elixir

54:15.970 --> 54:17.100
still be effective?

54:18.630 --> 54:19.430
Of course not.

54:20.480 --> 54:22.960
The Ethereal Flower is the core of the Herb Elixir.

54:22.960 --> 54:24.310
If the core is switched,

54:25.100 --> 54:25.840
the medicine

54:26.580 --> 54:27.840
will essentially be useless.

54:27.840 --> 54:29.440
As expected, it's the Zhi...

54:30.310 --> 54:32.710
As expected, it's the Zhi Lineage.

54:34.100 --> 54:36.760
Since I've cleared the Sword Wielder's doubts,

54:37.060 --> 54:38.060
I will return now.

54:38.670 --> 54:39.220
Wait.

54:41.700 --> 54:43.900
Sword Wielder, is there anything else?

54:44.430 --> 54:45.750
You said you will return.

54:45.750 --> 54:46.680
Return to where?

54:48.530 --> 54:49.730
You agreed not to ask,

54:49.810 --> 54:50.750
you liar!

54:52.920 --> 54:53.780
Sword Wielder,

54:54.870 --> 54:55.500
I think

54:56.230 --> 54:57.500
we'll meet again soon.

54:58.990 --> 54:59.720
At that time,

55:00.540 --> 55:01.860
you will know who I am.

55:03.060 --> 55:03.690
Goodbye.

55:04.510 --> 55:05.350
Brother Yue,

55:06.800 --> 55:07.800
let me see you off.

55:16.970 --> 55:18.290
Such a player.

55:19.300 --> 55:20.670
The books are right.

55:20.920 --> 55:22.330
All women are bad.

55:24.470 --> 55:26.400
What have you been reading lately?

55:30.540 --> 55:32.620
Should we first interrogate

55:32.640 --> 55:34.100
that suspicious servant?

55:37.850 --> 55:38.410
Jin Fan,

55:39.530 --> 55:40.590
hurry and find him.

55:40.980 --> 55:41.750
Now?

55:41.990 --> 55:42.810
It's so late.

55:42.950 --> 55:44.670
I'm afraid it's already too late.

55:44.670 --> 55:45.000
Okay.

56:12.470 --> 56:13.870
Thank you.

56:14.250 --> 56:15.580
The portraits are done.

56:24.270 --> 56:25.330
Thank you, my lord.

56:25.550 --> 56:26.670
Thank you

56:26.810 --> 56:28.540
for drawing me so beautifully.

56:49.790 --> 56:51.120
A few hours ago,

56:51.620 --> 56:53.050
it was still lively here.

56:53.910 --> 56:55.170
But in a blink of an eye,

56:55.280 --> 56:56.680
we are the only ones left.

56:57.480 --> 56:58.080
By the way,

56:58.590 --> 57:00.150
Miss Jiang has recovered

57:00.340 --> 57:02.470
and was sent out of the Gong residence.

57:05.190 --> 57:06.590
I thought you would care.

57:10.670 --> 57:12.130
After sitting for so long,

57:13.090 --> 57:14.220
my waist is in pain.

57:15.930 --> 57:16.860
I'm going to bed.

57:17.330 --> 57:18.790
You should rest early too.

57:24.450 --> 57:26.620
But I still want to chat with you.

57:28.110 --> 57:29.660
There's no one to talk to

57:29.910 --> 57:31.570
in such a big courtyard.

57:32.500 --> 57:33.840
It's quite scary.

57:38.360 --> 57:39.750
That's great.

57:56.220 --> 57:57.850
I asked you to bring the servant here.

57:57.850 --> 57:59.850
Why did you arrest Housekeeper Jia?

58:00.140 --> 58:00.670
I...

58:00.980 --> 58:01.910
When I went there,

58:01.910 --> 58:03.570
the servant was already gone.

58:04.510 --> 58:06.630
I saw the pharmacy's Housekeeper Jia looking sneaky.

58:06.630 --> 58:07.890
He's also suspicious,

58:08.060 --> 58:09.570
so I brought him here.

58:24.110 --> 58:25.270
How should we

58:25.350 --> 58:26.900
interrogate him?

58:27.370 --> 58:28.900
We should use the 18 methods

58:29.050 --> 58:31.110
of torture like, "I'll confess!"

58:33.140 --> 58:34.070
How about

58:34.260 --> 58:36.020
we go to Gong Yuanzhi's place

58:36.040 --> 58:37.700
and steal some poison for him?

58:38.560 --> 58:39.400
Let him speak.

58:40.140 --> 58:41.020
I'm done.

58:41.820 --> 58:43.080
I said to let him speak.

58:51.940 --> 58:52.940
Housekeeper Jia,

58:53.750 --> 58:56.410
you're a senior staff of the Gong residence now.

58:56.540 --> 58:57.610
For your dignity,

58:58.410 --> 59:00.210
I'll let you speak for yourself.

59:00.510 --> 59:01.610
What did the Zhi Lineage do?

59:01.610 --> 59:02.740
I don't understand.

59:03.240 --> 59:05.100
You can summon me if you need help.

59:05.430 --> 59:06.770
Why did you arrest me?

59:08.750 --> 59:09.710
Who ordered you

59:10.200 --> 59:13.060
to change the Ethereal Flower into the Spirit Herb?

59:20.470 --> 59:22.320
Sword Wielder, you lost your family.

59:22.320 --> 59:25.010
I know you need somewhere to vent your anger,

59:25.950 --> 59:27.170
but you can't slander

59:27.400 --> 59:29.670
the Zhi Lineage of switching the herbs.

59:34.460 --> 59:34.990
It seems

59:36.310 --> 59:38.370
that we've wronged Housekeeper Jia.

59:39.750 --> 59:40.260
Jin Fan.

59:40.740 --> 59:41.500
Untie him

59:41.620 --> 59:42.750
and escort him back.

59:47.360 --> 59:48.390
What are you waiting for?

59:48.390 --> 59:48.990
Untie him.

59:56.580 --> 59:57.180
Gong Ziyu,

59:57.270 --> 59:58.070
what's wrong with you?

59:58.070 --> 59:59.330
None of your business.

01:00:02.170 --> 01:00:03.770
In a while, everyone will see

01:00:04.220 --> 01:00:06.480
Jin Fan politely escort Housekeeper Jia

01:00:06.510 --> 01:00:08.370
out of the gates of the Yu Lineage.

01:00:08.530 --> 01:00:09.590
Tomorrow morning,

01:00:09.770 --> 01:00:11.200
I will release the news

01:00:12.040 --> 01:00:13.240
that Housekeeper Jia

01:00:13.470 --> 01:00:15.190
provided a critical clue for the former Sword Wielder's

01:00:15.190 --> 01:00:16.120
poisoning case.

01:00:16.870 --> 01:00:18.070
Then we will visit him

01:00:18.990 --> 01:00:20.500
with a grand reward.

01:00:30.250 --> 01:00:31.110
Sword Wielder,

01:00:31.890 --> 01:00:33.070
please forgive me.

01:00:34.870 --> 01:00:36.830
If this news reaches Gong Yuanzhi,

01:00:37.100 --> 01:00:39.030
it'll be the end of me.

01:00:41.170 --> 01:00:42.170
Housekeeper Jia,

01:00:43.360 --> 01:00:45.690
there are only two options in front of you.

01:00:46.110 --> 01:00:46.620
Either

01:00:47.220 --> 01:00:49.010
tell me everything you know

01:00:49.720 --> 01:00:52.250
and I can spare your life as the Sword Wielder,

01:00:52.940 --> 01:00:53.320
or

01:00:54.740 --> 01:00:56.360
keep playing tricks here,

01:00:57.870 --> 01:00:59.070
and we'll see about it

01:01:00.060 --> 01:01:01.050
in the morning.

01:01:12.500 --> 01:01:13.940
Sword Wielder, you are wise.

01:01:13.940 --> 01:01:15.370
I deserve to die.

01:01:16.630 --> 01:01:18.140
I was acting under orders.

01:01:18.310 --> 01:01:19.260
I had no choice

01:01:19.620 --> 01:01:21.750
but to switch out the Ethereal Flower.

01:01:23.380 --> 01:01:23.900
I...

01:01:25.440 --> 01:01:27.170
I'm willing to testify for you.

01:01:34.260 --> 01:01:35.310
Who is the person

01:01:36.670 --> 01:01:37.670
that ordered you?

01:01:41.400 --> 01:01:42.200
Gong Yuanzhi.

01:01:55.770 --> 01:01:56.700
What do you want?

01:01:58.460 --> 01:01:59.550
You're so nervous.

01:02:00.580 --> 01:02:02.320
You and I have become enemies.

01:02:03.060 --> 01:02:04.390
You belong to Gong Ziyu.

01:02:04.820 --> 01:02:06.280
I belong to Gong Shangjue.

01:02:06.800 --> 01:02:08.400
So many people are watching.

01:02:08.520 --> 01:02:10.120
Why are you chatting with me?

01:02:11.500 --> 01:02:12.630
What are your plans?

01:02:12.720 --> 01:02:13.650
What do you mean?

01:02:14.340 --> 01:02:15.320
What should we do

01:02:16.060 --> 01:02:16.980
in three days

01:02:16.980 --> 01:02:18.830
when Gong Shangjue brings back

01:02:20.110 --> 01:02:21.570
the information about us?

01:02:22.340 --> 01:02:23.870
Watch them be proven wrong.

01:02:24.250 --> 01:02:25.850
What's there to be afraid of?

01:02:27.190 --> 01:02:27.910
Could it be

01:02:28.500 --> 01:02:29.990
that you're not Yun Weishan?

01:02:29.990 --> 01:02:31.290
Of course not.

01:02:32.340 --> 01:02:33.300
Hanya Si and I

01:02:33.300 --> 01:02:35.490
attacked Miss Yun in Lixi Town

01:02:36.460 --> 01:02:37.590
and I took her place.

01:02:38.940 --> 01:02:40.340
Then, you're in trouble.

01:02:41.980 --> 01:02:42.840
What about you?

01:02:44.420 --> 01:02:46.150
Are you really Shangguan Qian?

01:02:47.340 --> 01:02:49.070
Shangguan Qian from Dafu City?

01:02:49.330 --> 01:02:49.820
Yes.

01:02:50.990 --> 01:02:52.760
I am Shangguan Qian.

01:02:55.840 --> 01:02:56.440
Remember,

01:02:57.190 --> 01:02:58.570
no matter what happens,

01:02:59.730 --> 01:03:01.530
you must insist on your identiy.

01:03:02.460 --> 01:03:03.680
You are Yun Weishan

01:03:04.670 --> 01:03:06.280
from Lixi Town.

01:03:08.070 --> 01:03:09.930
Then why are you the Mei of Wufeng?

01:03:11.350 --> 01:03:12.880
As a member of the Wufeng,

01:03:13.590 --> 01:03:15.120
you really have naive trust

01:03:16.050 --> 01:03:17.860
in a stranger.

01:03:19.140 --> 01:03:19.850
Stranger?

01:03:21.450 --> 01:03:21.950
Who?

01:03:24.750 --> 01:03:25.230
Me.

01:03:28.110 --> 01:03:31.030
My family sent me to train in Wufeng since I was a child,

01:03:31.030 --> 01:03:33.740
but I always returned during New Years

01:03:33.820 --> 01:03:35.020
or the Lantern Festival

01:03:35.020 --> 01:03:36.620
and showed myself in public.

01:03:37.580 --> 01:03:39.260
I also took advantage of those days

01:03:39.260 --> 01:03:42.320
to go on some blind dates with the city's rich families.

01:03:42.790 --> 01:03:43.670
The other days,

01:03:43.800 --> 01:03:46.130
my family would have a sickly maid

01:03:46.170 --> 01:03:47.200
pretend to be me

01:03:47.790 --> 01:03:49.030
and ask different doctors

01:03:49.030 --> 01:03:51.610
to take my pulse through a curtain.

01:03:53.270 --> 01:03:54.620
All kinds of prescriptions

01:03:54.620 --> 01:03:56.280
are brought to my house

01:03:56.590 --> 01:03:59.600
and piles of herbal residue are thrown out.

01:04:00.060 --> 01:04:00.770
Therefore,

01:04:01.660 --> 01:04:04.620
I can use the excuse of being sick

01:04:04.620 --> 01:04:06.110
to not leave the house

01:04:06.820 --> 01:04:08.460
and train in Wufeng.

01:04:09.260 --> 01:04:10.020
So,

01:04:10.540 --> 01:04:12.870
even if Gong Shangjue uses my portrait

01:04:13.380 --> 01:04:15.110
to verify throughout the city,

01:04:15.670 --> 01:04:17.390
he will only get one result.

01:04:18.540 --> 01:04:19.170
I

01:04:19.280 --> 01:04:20.600
am Shangguan Qian,

01:04:22.700 --> 01:04:24.430
a weak and sickly girl

01:04:24.830 --> 01:04:26.760
who doesn't like to go out.

01:04:30.310 --> 01:04:31.310
Then you can stay.

01:04:32.980 --> 01:04:33.800
I must go.

01:04:35.350 --> 01:04:36.550
I can't take the risk.

01:04:38.060 --> 01:04:39.120
What are you doing?

01:04:39.660 --> 01:04:40.460
Are you crazy?

01:04:46.230 --> 01:04:47.180
If I were you,

01:04:48.310 --> 01:04:49.310
I'd take a gamble.

01:04:52.180 --> 01:04:52.910
Gamble what?

01:04:53.620 --> 01:04:56.080
Gamble whether Wufeng has their hopes on you

01:04:56.460 --> 01:04:57.660
or has their hopes

01:04:57.660 --> 01:04:59.130
on Miss Zheng Nanyi

01:04:59.150 --> 01:05:01.480
who has already died after being exposed.

01:05:01.800 --> 01:05:02.730
What do you mean?

01:05:03.370 --> 01:05:05.300
With Miss Zheng Nanyi's skills

01:05:05.790 --> 01:05:07.870
and her idiotic brain,

01:05:10.280 --> 01:05:11.540
she'll at most be a Chi,

01:05:11.980 --> 01:05:13.220
just like you.

01:05:15.450 --> 01:05:16.230
Amazing.

01:05:17.850 --> 01:05:20.110
You insulted two people in one sentence.

01:05:20.790 --> 01:05:23.190
My mission is to get close to Gong Shangjue,

01:05:23.500 --> 01:05:25.360
while Miss Zheng Nanyi's mission

01:05:25.700 --> 01:05:27.500
can only be completed by you now.

01:05:28.830 --> 01:05:31.560
If Wufeng doesn't want to break this connection,

01:05:32.190 --> 01:05:32.800
I think

01:05:34.270 --> 01:05:35.800
they will find a way

01:05:36.290 --> 01:05:38.370
to prove your identity in Lixi Town.

01:05:39.380 --> 01:05:40.640
For Wufeng,

01:05:40.950 --> 01:05:42.690
there's nothing they can't do

01:05:43.430 --> 01:05:44.860
as long as they want to.

01:05:46.120 --> 01:05:47.320
Remember what I said.

01:05:48.300 --> 01:05:49.270
No matter what,

01:05:50.240 --> 01:05:52.040
you must insist on your identiy.

01:05:53.390 --> 01:05:54.450
You are Yun Weishan

01:05:55.550 --> 01:05:56.580
from Lixi Town.

01:06:02.440 --> 01:06:03.600
[Jue]

01:06:30.290 --> 01:06:31.620
What are you looking at?

01:06:33.780 --> 01:06:35.570
The pigeon brought back

01:06:35.590 --> 01:06:38.110
the investigation on Yun Weishan and Shangguan Qian

01:06:38.110 --> 01:06:38.910
early.

01:06:39.430 --> 01:06:41.010
Is it as you expected?

01:06:44.200 --> 01:06:46.000
Did you bring the hidden weapon?

01:06:47.580 --> 01:06:48.040
Yes.

01:06:49.910 --> 01:06:50.440
Let's go.
